<title>USA: Capital Gaming changes trading symbol.</title>
<headline>Capital Gaming changes trading symbol.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, N.J. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Gaming International Inc said on Friday its trading symbol changed to CGMI.OB on the Nasdaq OTC Bulletin board.</p>
<p>The change will take place with immediate effect. The company's previous symbol was GDFI.OB.</p>
<p>Capital Gaming is a multi-jurisdictional casino development and management company with interest in the native American gaming markets.</p>
</text>
